usage: map_obligations.py [-h] [--map MAP] [--frozen FROZEN] [--self-test]
                          [cluster]

Compare raw source-attributed JSON obligations with a canonical map

positional arguments:
  cluster          cluster directory

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --map MAP        map path within the cluster
  --frozen FROZEN  verify input SHA-256 pins and replay expected.json from
                   this directory
  --self-test      exercise isolated CLI cases
